# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 1fdb1bab8d299ba2e8529a6bb77cbe7e87a4b8948142026c2015fbea4b2c1a30
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 2ac1c629eb223a9a0494912bed9c65de61a6b2dbf38cca8bf3ee54b16fa47309
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 781f6c912a19154dbe336f50538158b3ee5fa8c44c07155dbd0985a265a2144e
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock e8e3433c2f0c8358b3a7f70106f083f30996038e5921e56b1cbbdafbe90ae1d2
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes ee7372687eb1bf6a443d373735addff0bd37dd73325c356f02257f7adf502509
